== Trivia ==
*Sometimes, '''Tia's''' head turns way faster than her body.
*'''Tia''' explains that when Fairies die, they become a [[Fairy Soul]], this is not the case in [[The Catacombs]], but is demonstrated live in {{Zone|Stillgore Chateau}}.
*{{NPCSprite|Tal Ker}} claims, that Tia told him that all the fairies were killed, rather than dying a peaceful death.

